<title>USA: Community Banks sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Community Banks sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MILLERSBURG, Penn. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Banks Inc said on Tuesday its board declared a five percent stock dividend payable on April 8, payable to shareholders of record on March 24.</p>
<p>The company also said its board declared an annualized dividend of $0.84 per share, up from the previous $0.80 per share annual dividend. A quarterly cash dividend of $0.21 per share would be payable on April 1 to shareholders of record on March 17, the company said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
